<p>This site uses no advertising or tracking cookies, and no third-party analytics.</p>

<p>Only one <strong>technical</strong> cookie is stored when you fill in a form (for example, the Complaints
Book): it checks that the submission was made by a person from this page and not by an automated program. It
is deleted when you close your browser and holds no personal data.</p>

<p>Photos and videos shown here may load from external services (for example, YouTube), which apply their own
cookie policy when you play them.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, write to us at <a href="mailto:{{ front.correo }}">{{ front.correo }}</a>.</p>
